Flycast (Sega Dreamcast) libretro core, compiled to WebAssembly.

Upstream: https://github.com/flyinghead/flycast — GPL-2.0-or-later.
Browser core binary (flycast_libretro.js / flycast_libretro.wasm) sourced from
the npm package romdev-core-flycast@0.1.0 (single-threaded, reios HLE BIOS).

The browser libretro frontend in this directory (dc-wasm.js) is original to
this repository. Because it links against the GPL-2.0 Flycast core at runtime,
treat the combined Dreamcast player as GPL-2.0-or-later.
